Consider the following Java code fragment. What value is printed to the console?

```java
int[][] matrix = {
    {3, 5, 7},
    {2, 4, 6},
    {1, 8, 9}
};

int sum = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < matrix.length; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < matrix[i].length; j++) {
        if (i == j) {
            sum += matrix[i][j];
        } else if (i + j == matrix.length - 1) {
            sum += matrix[i][j] * 2;
        }
    }
}
System.out.println(sum);
```

